"Menaiho, ikona [recyklácie](https://thenounproject.com/icon/"
"recycling-5458016/) od Kosong Tujuh, ikona [bagra](https://thenounproject."
"com/icon/excavator-576937/) od Petra van Driela, ikona [jedu](https://"
"thenounproject.com/icon/poison-3201818/) od Adriena Coqueta, všetky "
