msgstr "[Licencia](https://invent.kde.org/pim/kmail/-/blob/master/LICENSES)"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1088
msgid ""
"An example of documentation for the Blue Angel can be found in [Annex 5]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/teams/eco/blue-angel-application/-/blob/master/"
"applications/kmail/de-uz-215-eng-annex-5-kmail.md)."
msgstr ""
"Príklad dokumentácie pre Blue Angel nájdete v [Annex 5](https://invent.kde."
"org/teams/eco/blue-angel-application/-/blob/master/applications/kmail/de-"
"uz-215-eng-annex-5-kmail.md)."

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1091
msgid "2.3 Continuity Of Support"
msgstr "2.3 Kontinuita podpory"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1093
msgid "Details about continuity of support to document include:"
msgstr "Podrobnosti o kontinuite podpory, ktoré treba zdokumentovať, zahŕňajú:"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1095
msgid ""
"Information about how long the software has been supported for (with links "
"to release announcements)."
msgstr ""
"Informácie o tom, ako dlho je softvér podporovaný (s odkazmi na oznámenia "
"vydaní)."

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1097
msgid "Release schedule and details (e.g., who maintains the software)."
msgstr "Harmonogram a podrobnosti vydaní (napr. kto softvér udržiava)."

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1099
msgid "Statement that updates are free of charge."
msgstr "Vyhlásenie, že aktualizácie sú bezplatné."

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1101
msgid ""
"Declaration on how the free and open source software license enables "
"continuous support indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"Vyhlásenie o tom, ako licencia slobodného a otvoreného softvéru umožňuje "
"nepretržitú podporu donekonečna."

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1103
msgid ""
"Information about whether and how functional and security updates may be "
"installed separately."
msgstr ""
"Informácie o tom, či a ako možno funkčné a bezpečnostné aktualizácie "
"inštalovať samostatne."

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1105
msgid ""
"An example of Okular’s continuity of support documentation for the Blue "
