"teams/eco/blue-angel-application/-/blob/master/applications/okular/de-uz-215-"
"eng-annex-6-okular.md)."
msgstr ""
"Príklad dokumentácie kontinuity podpory Okularu pre Blue Angel nájdete v "
"časti 3.1.3.3 [Annex 6](https://invent.kde.org/teams/eco/blue-angel-"
"application/-/blob/master/applications/okular/de-uz-215-eng-annex-6-okular."
"md)."

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1107
msgid "2.4 Uninstallability"
msgstr "2.4 Odinštalovateľnosť"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1109
msgid ""
"How are users able to completely uninstall the software? Relevant details "
"might include:"
msgstr ""
"Ako môžu používatelia softvér úplne odinštalovať? Relevantné podrobnosti "
"môžu zahŕňať:"

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1111
msgid ""
"Uninstallation instructions that depend on how the software was installed "
"(source code or binary)."
msgstr ""
"Pokyny na odinštalovanie, ktoré závisia od toho, ako bol softvér "
"nainštalovaný (zdrojový kód alebo binárny súbor)."

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1113
msgid ""
"Examples of uninstallation instructions (source code or package managers, "
"with relevant links to documentation)."
msgstr ""
"Príklady pokynov na odinštalovanie (zdrojový kód alebo správcovia balíkov, s "
"relevantnými odkazmi na dokumentáciu)."

#: content/be4foss-handbook/handbook_web.md:1115
msgid ""
"Information about whether user-generated data is also removed when "
