#: content/opt-green-handbook/index.md:740
msgid ""
"The *Opt Green* project from KDE Eco was funded by the Federal Environment "
"Agency and the Federal Ministry for the Environment, Climate Action, Nature "
"Conservation and Nuclear Safety (BMUKN). The funds are made available by "
"resolution of the German Bundestag."
msgstr ""
"Projekt *Opt Green* od KDE Eco bol financovaný Spolkovou agentúrou pre "
"životné prostredie a Spolkovým ministerstvom pre životné prostredie, ochranu "
"klímy, ochranu prírody a jadrovú bezpečnosť (BMUKN). Prostriedky sú "
"sprístupnené na základe uznesenia nemeckého Spolkového snemu."

#: content/opt-green-handbook/index.md:744
msgid ""
"![Logo of the Federal Ministry for the Environment, Climate Action, Nature "
"Conservation and Nuclear Safety.](images/sec4_bmuv.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Logo Spolkového ministerstva pre životné prostredie, ochranu klímy, "
"ochranu prírody a jadrovú bezpečnosť.](images/sec4_bmuv.png)"

#: content/sustainable-goal/_index.md:0
msgid "Sustainable Software Goal"
msgstr "Ciel udrzatelneho softveru"

#: content/sustainable-goal/_index.md:9
msgid ""
"Software has an impact on our future. It has an affect on energy and "
"resource usage. KDE can deliver software which does this in a way which "
"preserves environment and society for us and future generations. KDE can "
"deliver Sustainable Software."
msgstr ""
"Softver ma vplyv na nasu buducnost. Ovplyvnuje spotrebu energie a zdrojov. "
"KDE moze dodavat softver, ktory to robi sposobom, ktory zachovava zivotne "
"prostredie a spolocnost pre nas a buduce generacie. KDE moze dodavat "
"udrzatelny softver."

#: content/sustainable-goal/_index.md:11
msgid ""
"The sustainable software goal is about promoting sustainability in KDE by "
"aligning existing activities, highlighting where our software is already "
"sustainably designed, stimulating actions to increase sustainability, and "
"creating standards/tools to quantify software sustainability."
msgstr ""
"Ciel udrzatelneho softveru je o propagacii udrzatelnosti v KDE zosladenim "
"existujucich aktivit, zdoraznenim, kde je nas softver uz udrzatelne "
"navrhnuty, stimulaciou akcii na zvysenie udrzatelnosti a vytvaranim "
"standardov/nastrojov na kvantifikaciu udrzatelnosti softveru."

#. home.header
#: i18n/en.yaml:2
msgid "Opt Green"
msgstr "Opt Green"

#. home.header-subtitle
#: i18n/en.yaml:4
msgid ""
"Independent, energy-efficient Free & Open Source Software for long-term "
"hardware use."
msgstr ""
"Nezavisly, energeticky efektivny slobodny a otvorenozdrojovy softver pre "
"dlhodobe pouzivanie hardveru."

#. home.sustainability-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:6
msgid "Be Green (End User)"
msgstr "Budte zeleni (koncovy pouzivatel)"

#. home.sustainability-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:8
msgid ""
"Opt in to lower energy demands, extended hardware life, device independence, "
"and user control for a healthier digital society."
msgstr ""
"Zapojte sa do znizenych energetickych narokov, predlzenej zivotnosti "
"hardveru, nezavislosti zariadeni a kontroly pouzivatelov pre zdravsiu "
"digitalnu spolocnost."

#. home.advocate-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:10
msgid "Grow Green (Advocate)"
msgstr "Rastite zeleno (zastanca)"

#. home.advocate-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:12
msgid ""
"Build communities and user support networks to bring the benefits of "
"independent, sustainable software to your hometown."
msgstr ""
"Budujte komunity a siete podpory pouzivatelov na prinesenie vyhod "
"nezavisleho, udrzatelneho softveru do vasho rodneho mesta."

#. home.impact-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:14
msgid "Make Green (Dev)"
msgstr "Tvorte zeleno (vyvojar)"

#. home.impact-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:16
msgid ""
"Develop applications and software features with a focus on efficiency and "
"sustainability for this and future generations."
msgstr ""
"Vyvijajte aplikacie a softverove funkcie so zameranim na efektivnost a "
"udrzatelnost pre tuto a buduce generacie."

#. home.about-foss-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:18
msgid "What makes FOSS sustainable?"
msgstr "Co robi FOSS udrzatelnym?"

#. home.featured-blog-posts-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:20
msgid "Featured blog posts"
msgstr "Odporucane blogove prispevky"

#. home.events-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:22
msgid "Events"
msgstr "Udalosti"

#. home.about-foss-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:24
msgid ""
"Free & Open Source Software (FOSS) guarantees transparency and user "
"autonomy, by design. These are not features, but inherent qualities to open "
"development and software licensing. As a result, software and hardware are "
"no longer dependent on vendors for support."
msgstr ""
"Slobodny a otvorenozdrojovy softver (FOSS) zarucuje transparentnost a "
"autonomiu pouzivatelov, zo svojej podstaty. To nie su funkcie, ale "
"vlastnosti otvoreeneho vyvoja a licencovania softveru. V dosledku toho "
"softver a hardver uz nie su zavisls od dodavatelov pre podporu."

#. home.about-foss-description-2
#: i18n/en.yaml:26
msgid ""
"FOSS can be studied and improved independently, including in its energy "
"consumption. Premature hardware obsolescence is a thing of the past. FOSS "
"runs on devices that are decades old. Keep your computer in use to the end "
"of the hardware operating life, not the software."
msgstr ""
"FOSS sa da studovat a zlepsovat nezavisle, vratane jeho spotreby energie. "
"Predcasna zastaralost hardveru je minulostou. FOSS bezi na zariadeniach, "
"ktore su desatrocia stare. Udrzujte svoj pocitac v pouzivani do konca "
"zivotnosti hardveru, nie softveru."

#. home.about-kde-title
#: i18n/en.yaml:28
msgid "About KDE and KDE Eco"
msgstr "O KDE a KDE Eco"

#. home.about-kde-description-kde
#: i18n/en.yaml:30
msgid ""
"KDE is a world-wide community of software engineers, artists, writers, "
"translators, and creators who are committed to Free Software development. We "
"are a cooperative enterprise: we work together to achieve the common goal of "
"building the world's finest Free & Open Source Software. Everyone is welcome "
"to join and contribute to KDE, including you."
msgstr ""
"KDE je celosvetova komunita softverovych inzinierov, umelcov, pisatelov, "
"prekladatelov a tvorcov oddanych vyvoju slobodneho softveru. Sme "
"kooperativny podnik: pracujeme spolocne na dosiahnuti spolocneho ciela "
"budovania najlepsieho slobodneho a otvorenozdrojoveho softveru na svete. "
"Kazdy je vitany pridat sa a prispievat do KDE, vratane vas."

#. home.about-kde-description-kde-2
#: i18n/en.yaml:32
msgid ""
"Supported by the KDE community since 2021, KDE Eco has the ongoing mission "
"of the development and adoption of sustainable Free & Open Source Software "
"worldwide. As the ecological impact of digitization grows more relevant, we "
"continue to raise awareness about the role of software design in reducing "
"environmental harm. We are proudly a part of a growing number of communities "
"and organizations working to have a positive ecological impact, today."
msgstr ""
"Podporovane komunitou KDE od roku 2021, KDE Eco ma prebiehajucu misiu vyvoja "
"a adopcie udrzatelneho slobodneho a otvorenozdrojoveho softveru celosvetovo."

#. home.header.sustainable-goal.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:34
msgid ""
"Software has a direct affect on energy and resource consumption. Since 2022, "
"KDE has the goal of providing software which does this in a way that reduces "
"software’s environmental impact for us and future generations."
msgstr ""
"Softver ma priamy vplyv na spotrebu energie a zdrojov. Od roku 2022 ma KDE "
"ciel poskytovat softver, ktory to robi sposobom, ktory znizuje "
"environmentalny dopad softveru pre nas a buduce generacie."

#. home.header.feep.subtitle
#: i18n/en.yaml:36
msgid "Free and open source software Energy Efficiency Project"
msgstr ""
"Projekt energetickej efektivity slobodneho a otvorenozdrojoveho softveru"

#. home.header.feep.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:38
msgid ""
"How can you measure software’s energy consumption? And does it make a "
"difference? We are working to make free software more sustainable."
msgstr "*A je v tom rozdiel?*"

#. home.header.be4foss.subtitle
#: i18n/en.yaml:40
msgid "Blauer Engel for Free and Open Source Software"
msgstr "Blauer Engel pre slobodny a otvorenozdrojovy softver"

#. home.header.be4foss.description
#: i18n/en.yaml:42
msgid ""
"Eco-labels for products are used widely already. But how can they be "
"transferred to software? What criteria is relevant? We need more pioneers to "
"find out how we can make software sustainable."
msgstr ""
"Ekoznacky pre produkty su uz siroko pouzivane. Ale ako sa daju preniest na "
"softver? Ake kriteria su relevantne? Potrebujeme viac priekopnikov, aby sme "
"zistili, ako mozeme urobit softver udrzatelnym."

#. home.header.more
#: i18n/en.yaml:44 i18n/en.yaml:149 i18n/en.yaml:175
msgid "Learn More"
msgstr "Zistiť viac"

#. home.eco-handbook
#: i18n/en.yaml:46
msgid "KDE Eco Handbook"
msgstr "KDE Eco"

#. home.about-website
#: i18n/en.yaml:48
msgid "About This Website"
msgstr "O tejto webovej stranke"

#. home.about-website-description
#: i18n/en.yaml:50
msgid ""
"This website is open-source. Source code and asset licenses can be found in "
"the [KDE Eco Repository](https://invent.kde.org/websites/eco-kde-org). This "
"website was checked by the [greenwebfoundation.org](https://www."
"thegreenwebfoundation.org/green-web-check/?url=https%3A%2F%2Feco.kde.org) "
"and is labelled \"Hosted Green\". Website is hosted by: Hetzner Online AG. "
"Supporting evidence for this hoster’s claims: [Sustainability Page](https://"
"www.hetzner.com/unternehmen/umweltschutz)."
msgstr ""
"Tato webova stranka je open-source. Zdrojovy kod a licencie aktiv najdete v "
"[KDE Eco repozitari](https://invent.kde.org/websites/eco-kde-org). Tato "
"webova stranka bola skontrolovana [greenwebfoundation.org](https://www."
"thegreenwebfoundation.org/green-web-check/?url=https%3A%2F%2Feco.kde.org) a "
"je oznacena ako \"Hosted Green\"."

#. home.eco-handbook.alt
#: i18n/en.yaml:52
msgid "Plots of real time measurements using KDE’s LabPlot."
msgstr "Grafy merani v realnom case pomocou LabPlot od KDE."

#. home.okular
#: i18n/en.yaml:54
msgid "Okular Awarded Blue Angel Ecolabel"
msgstr "Okular ziskal ekoznacku Blue Angel"

#. home.okular.be
#: i18n/en.yaml:56
msgid ""
"In 2022, KDE’s popular multi-platform PDF reader and universal document "
"viewer Okular became the first ever eco-certified computer program!"
msgstr ""
"V roku 2022 sa popularny multiplatformovy PDF citac a univerzalny prezerac "
"dokumentov Okular od KDE stal prvym ekocertifikovanym pocitacovym programom "
"vobec!"

#. home.okular.pr
#: i18n/en.yaml:58 i18n/en.yaml:195 i18n/en.yaml:231
msgid "Read More"
msgstr "Citat viac"

#. home.engage.joinus
#: i18n/en.yaml:62
msgid "Join us in the sustainable software development movement!"
msgstr "Pridajte sa k nam v hnuti vyvoja udrzatelneho softveru!"

#. home.engage.repo
#: i18n/en.yaml:64
